# ===== The Veil, task 5: Friends upcast - _2.._6, and the old Faux Amis on _6 (spec D14) =====
# Apply in Task 6, after `gen_upcast_variants.pl --apply` (the plan's order, like 25_mirror_image_upcast.patch), and only
# after 50_kit.patch (which makes the base a level-1 spell paid with SpellSlotsGroup and removes Friends_EX).
#
# Unlike 25, this patch CREATES the variants: gen_upcast_variants.pl only makes variants of
# `_Arcana_(Card_Spell|Card_Ability|Card_Passive|Created)_` spells ($WANTS_VARIANTS), never `_Arcana_Util_`, and its
# cleanup only deletes variants of those same kinds, so these five are never generated, deleted or rewritten by it.
# They are written exactly in the generator's shape (SpellType before `using`, RootSpellID, PowerLevel, UseCosts).
# The Arcana slots have one level at a time (ceil(character level / 2)), so without _2.._6 Friends could not be cast
# from character level 3 on: all five are needed (granted at level 1 -> first slot 1 -> variants 2..6).
# This patch does not depend on the generator, so it dry-runs today together with 50_kit.patch.

# _6 = Faux Amis (the fields of the deleted Target_Arcana_Util_Friends_EX): FRIENDS_EX (permanent, Advantage on Charisma
# checks in dialogue, none of vanilla FRIENDS' hostility or difficulty rules), no Concentration (no IsConcentration flag),
# no hostility warning. Its description is Faux Amis' own (handle h74b1ce07, used by nothing else once Friends_EX goes).
# The name stays "Friends", as in every vanilla upcast. FollowUpOriginalSpell and Temporary are not carried over: they
# belonged to the old granted copy, not to an upcast.

# Written _6 first: stats_add.pl puts each new child right after its parent, so the file ends up _2.._6.
@file Spell_Target
@section Target_DECEIVER SPELLS

new entry "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends_6"
type "SpellData"
data "SpellType" "Target"
using "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends"
data "RootSpellID" "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends"
data "PowerLevel" "6"
data "UseCosts" "ActionPoint:1;SpellSlotsGroup:1:1:6;"
data "SpellProperties" "ApplyStatus(FRIENDS_EX,100,-1);"
data "Description" "{{h74b1ce07gffdbgf84fgf853gddb733fa8f51}}"
data "TooltipStatusApply" "ApplyStatus(FRIENDS_EX,100,-1)"
data "TooltipPermanentWarnings" ""
data "SpellFlags" "IsSpell;HasSomaticComponent"

new entry "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends_5"
type "SpellData"
data "SpellType" "Target"
using "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends"
data "RootSpellID" "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends"
data "PowerLevel" "5"
data "UseCosts" "ActionPoint:1;SpellSlotsGroup:1:1:5;"

new entry "Target_Arcana_Util_Friends_4"
type "SpellData"
